  "about": "Test vectors for the six-digit codes of pairing within one Kettu account. single: SHA-256 over 'kettu-pair-code/1', the handshake hash, the host nonce and the device nonce. group: SHA-256 over 'kettu-pair-code-group/1', then for each host in order its relay id in ASCII, handshake hash, host nonce and device nonce. Each code is the digest's first four bytes as a big-endian number, modulo 1,000,000, padded to six digits. Bytes are base64url without padding.",
